        <p source="#source-259235-260128"><seg source="#source-259235-259286">盤古氏、天地万物之祖也、然則生物始</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259286-259298">二</note><seg source="#source-259298-259307">於盤古</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259307-259319">一</note><seg source="#source-259319-259352">、昔盤古氏之死也、頭為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259352-259364">二</note><seg source="#source-259364-259370">四岳</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259370-259382">一</note><seg source="#source-259382-259391">、目為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259391-259403">二</note><seg source="#source-259403-259409">日月</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259409-259421">一</note><seg source="#source-259421-259436">、脂、膏為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259436-259448">二</note><seg source="#source-259448-259454">江海</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259454-259466">一</note><seg source="#source-259466-259478">、毛髪為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259478-259490">二</note><seg source="#source-259490-259496">草木</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259496-259508">一</note><seg source="#source-259508-259547">、秦漢、間俗説、盤古氏頭為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259547-259559">二</note><seg source="#source-259559-259565">東岳</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259565-259577">一</note><seg source="#source-259577-259586">、腹為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-259586-259598">二</note><seg source="#source-259598-259604">中岳</seg><note type="kunten" subty