        <p source="#source-386361-386921"><seg source="#source-386361-386367">古有</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386367-386379">二</note><seg source="#source-386379-386385">大禹</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386385-386397">一</note><seg source="#source-386397-386445">、女禍十九代孫、寿三百六十歳、入</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386445-386457">二</note><seg source="#source-386457-386466">九嶷山</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386466-386478">一</note><seg source="#source-386478-386517">仙飛去、後三千六百歳、堯理</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386517-386529">二</note><seg source="#source-386529-386535">天下</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386535-386547">一</note><seg source="#source-386547-386571">、洪水既甚、人民</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-5-9" source="#source-386571-386616">墊</g><seg source="#source-386616-386631">溺、大禹念</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386631-386643">レ</note><seg source="#source-386643-386655">之、仍化</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386655-386667">二</note><seg source="#source-386667-386682">生於石紐山</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386682-386694">一</note><seg source="#source-386694-386712">、泉女狄暮汲</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386712-386724">レ</note><seg source="#source-386724-386733">水、得</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386733-386745">二</note><seg source="#source-386745-386751">石子</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-386751-386763">一</note><seg source="#source-386763-386769">、如</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" so